# NOTE: app/persistent-debug.keystore is intentionally tracked:
# it is a public debug keystore shipped with the upstream OpenTune
# project (used for reproducible debug builds / CI). Release signing
# uses environment variables (STORE_PASSWORD, KEY_ALIAS, KEY_PASSWORD)
# and app/keystore/release.keystore which is NOT present in this repo.
app/keystore/
